  "editorial": {
    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "The third of the three prayers before Communion. Like the second, it carries no rubric segment: the witnesses print one rubric for all three, and it stands at the head of ordinarium.qui-dixisti. PERCÉPTIO at w001 is absent from Whitaker's lexicon, so its provenance names Collatinus alone. QUOD at w007 is neuter and picks up Córporis, not the feminine Percéptio that governs the sentence : gender decides it, and the neuter antecedent happens also to stand nearer. PERCIPIÉNDAM at w033 is a gerundive, written as SCHEMA.md requires: a future passive participle, mood part, tense fut, voice pass, with the case, number and gender of medélam. PROSIT at w023 is prosum, a compound of sum, so it carries no conjugation.",
    "source": {
      "method": "Verified by collation against the independent witnesses below: zero substantive divergence. The accidental variants are adjudicated in the apparatus.",
      "witnesses": "witnesses/ordinarium.perceptio-corporis/",
